        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Ochre Easel loader sample, as reported in campaign PTF-02448. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Ochre Easel Loader: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-02448)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Ochre Easel Loader: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Ochre Easel loader in campaign PTF-02448.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"8e436f9f3870589390e9daa0755c4f9c6e2e6034ad6f37c9879520e8c045fd50\", \"cd28e2b27a6d5552f739ba245781a48532d542298fba0d2ec876833423b000b7\", \"c425b72ab7c812d4287712a1ec3279774b8cf6d6e5bf70bdb29056b38262c958\", \"71e2c541d50dd75ff8514a75f5107baa317c7006ce82df487e7a62f3f924da0c\", \"cb8298e2730499a626a349c62cc2703e267b420a2b6e17e29fdada3e8ce147df\", \"a306702e911769da199dad5f8fa585d4b308170e6bd9679b9df2969504dda8f6\", \"af681e5a512e826ab68a31568fe6fec9b64a7672fc62af344fb43eaf3a280abd\", \"a7712d4ad9e07db374f5fa2ba65c269e05eaf57372992af6df70fdef64a78bc5\", \"e4835a8d63273b142d002d769f259fe2386a29b12428fd37adf91b23344ce267\", \"a7346ff86aedf69e963a88bebf543d68167b2ae0e56d602b7f84bef8286d8a28\", \"92d07bfe5f2760c88a3b829f454f11507f8f84331994032feacea30fc2578f12\")",
